    "name": "EIS Payment Settlement Entity",
    "description": "This service domain performs the funds movements between customer and internal bank accounts in support of internal and interbank settlement using any appropriate payment rail.\n## Service Domain Role:\nThis service domain performs the funds movements between the customer account and an internal bank account or holding account to ensure funds are available for interbank settlement by the Payment Rail. This may involve the principal payment transfer as well as for fees.\n## Example of Use:\nA payment once authorized and confirmed is passed for settlement where one or more funds transfers are intiated through an external payment rail.\n## Key Features:\nFunds movement between Funding Account and Holding Account Reversing Earmarked funds.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: EIS\n Email: EISSupportTeam@seacoastbank.com",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "55818694",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/55818694-b1d4ff9d-d175-4e47-ae90-f851f86b5411?source=collection_link"
